<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Plautdietsch</book>
  <para style="h">Paulus sien tweeda Breef aun de Tessalonicha</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tess</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Tess</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paulus sien tweeda Breef aun de Tessalonicha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Paulus sien tweeda Breef aun de Tessalonicha</para>
  <para style="cl">2. Tessalonicha</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s">De Gruss</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Paulus un Silvanus un Timotäus aun de Jemeent von de Tessalonicha en Gott, onsem Voda, un däm Harn Jesus Christus: <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1Tess 1:1</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Jnod met junt un Fräd von Gott, onsem Voda, un däm Harn Jesus Christus!<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dank jäwen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Wie sellen Gott emma danken fa junt, Breeda, soo aus sikj daut jehieet, wiels jun Gloowen waust äwarut, un de Leew von eenem jiedren von junt nemt too em Äwafluss jäajenenaunda, <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3">1Tess 1:2-3</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />soo daut wie selfst ons en junt riemen en Gott siene Jemeenten wäajens june Jedult un Gloowen en aul june Vefoljungen un Triebsaulen, dee jie dulden: <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CO 7:4">2Kor 7:4</ref></char><verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Christus kjemt toom Jerecht</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Woont een openboaret Tieekjen von Gott sien jerajchtet Jerecht es, daut jie wirdich je-acht woaren fa Gott sien Rikj, fa woont jie uk lieden; <char style="rq"><ref loc="PHP 1:28">Flp 1:28</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />wiels daut bie Gott rajcht es, deejanje met Triebsaul to betolen, dee junt bedrekjen, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Ree 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:6-7">Opb 18:6-7</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />un junt, dee jie bedrekjt woaren, Ru met ons, wan de Har Jesus woat openboat woaren vom Himmel met de Enjel von siene Macht <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:31-36">25:31-36</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:16">1Tess 4:16</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />un met flaumendet Fia deejanje de Rach to tolen, dee Gott nich kjanen un dee, dee daut Evangelium von ons Har Jesus Christus nich jehuarsom sent; <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 2:8">Ree 2:8</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />woone Strof lieden woaren, eewjet Vedoawen, von däm Harn sien Aunjesecht un von de Harlichkjeit von siene Macht, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />wan Hee komen woat, om aun janem Dach veharlicht to woaren en siene Heilje un bewundat en aul dee, dee jejleeft haben; (wiels ons Zeichnis mank<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ooda: aun.</char></note> junt es jejleeft worden). <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Wuawäajen wie uk emma fa junt bäden, daut ons Gott junt wirdich helt fa de Beroopunk un aul daut Wooljefaulen von siene Gootheit erfelt un daut Woakj vom Gloowen en Krauft, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />soo daut de Nomen von ons Har Jesus Christus en junt veharlicht woat, un jie en Am, no de Jnod von ons Gott un däm Harn Jesus Christus.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="cl">2. Tessalonicha</para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">De Sän vom Vedoawen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Oba wie bedden junt, Breeda, wäajens daut Komen von ons Har Jesus Christus un ons Vesaumelt-woaren met Am, <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-17">1Tess 4:13-17</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />daut jie nich leicht bewäajcht woaren en de Jesennunk, uk nich veschrakjen, nich derch Jeist, nich derch Wuat un nich derch eenen Breef, soo aus von ons, aus wan Christus sien Dach tojäajen es. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2PE 3:15-16">2Pe 3:15-16</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Lot junt von kjeenem opp irjent eene Wies vefieren, wiels dee kjemt nich, ea ieescht de Auffaul kjemt un de Mensch von de Sind jeopenboat woat, de Sän von daut Vedoawen, <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TI 4:1">1Tim 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:18">1Joh 2:18</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />dee een Jäajna es un sikj selfst opphäft äwa aules, waut Gott heet ooda fa de Aunbädunk es, soo daut hee sikj aus Gott en Gott sien Tempel dolsat un sikj selfst väastalt, Gott to sennen. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24:15</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Denkj jie nich doaraun, aus ekj noch bie junt wia, daut ekj junt dit säd?<verse eid="2TH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Un nu, jie weeten, waut daut opphelt, daut hee to siene Tiet jeopenboat woat. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Wiels daut Jeheemnis von de Jesazloosichkjeit wirkjt aul, bloos nu es dee doa, dee noch opphelt, bat dee ute Medd jenomen woat, <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />un dan woat de Jesazloosa jeopenboat woaren, woonen de Har venichten woat derch dän Jeist von sien Mul un woat am venichten derch de Erschienunk von sien Komen, <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 11:4">Joh 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">Opb 19:15</ref>,<ref loc="REV 19:20">20</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />am, däm sien Komen no de Wirkjunk von däm Soton es, en aule Macht un aule Tieekjens un lieejenhaufte Wunda <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat 24:24</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:11-14">Opb 13:11-14</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />un met aul daut Vefieren von Ojjerajchtichkjeit aun deejanje, dee veloaren gonen, doawäajen, daut see de Leew von de Woarheit nich aunneemen, om daut see jerat worden. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Doawäajen schekjt Gott äant kjraftje Errtiema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ooda: Enbildungen.</char></note>, daut see de Lieej jleewen, <char style="rq"><ref loc="2TI 4:4">2Tim 4:4</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />soo daut aule jerecht woaren, dee de Woarheit nich jejleeft haben, oba Jefaulen hauden aun de Ojjerajchtichkjeit.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stot faust</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Oba wie sellen Gott emma danken fa junt, vom Harn jeleewde Breeda, daut Gott junt vom Aunfank fa de Radunk jewält haft derch de Heiljunk vom Jeist un derch dän Gloowen von<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ooda: aun.</char></note> de Woarheit, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ROM 8:30">Ree 8:30</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />wuatoo Hee junt beroopen haft derch ons Evangelium, om de Harlichkjeit von ons Har Jesus Christus to erlangen.<verse eid="2TH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Doawäajen, Breeda, stot faust un hoolt de Ordnungen, dee junt jelieet worden sent, entwäda derch Wuat ooda derch onsen Breef. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2TH 3:6">2Tess 3:6</ref></char><verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Mucht deeselwja Har Jesus Christus un ons Gott un Voda, dee ons jeleeft un ons eenen eewjen Troost un goode Hopninj jejäft haft derch Jnod, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />june Hoaten treesten un bestädjen en jieda goodet Wuat un Woakj.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="cl">2. Tessalonicha</para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Bät fa ons</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Schlieslich, Breeda, bät fa ons, daut däm Harn sien Wuat ranen un veharlicht woaren mucht, jrod soo aus bie junt, <char style="rq"><ref loc="EPH 6:18-19">Efs 6:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:3">Kol 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:25">1Tess 5:25</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />un daut wie jerat woaren von de vekjieede un beese Menschen, wiels see haben nich aula dän Gloowen. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Oba de Har es tru, dee uk junt bestädjen un von däm Beesen bewoaren woat. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 17:15">Joh 17:15</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:4">1Tess 5:4</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Wie oba haben Vetruen en däm Harn äwa junt, daut jie daut, waut wie jebeeden, soogoot doonen un uk doonen woaren. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CO 7:16">2Kor 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:10">Gal 5:10</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />De Har oba lenkj june Hoaten no Gott siene Leew un no Christus siene aunhoolende Jedult!<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woarnunk jäajen de Onordnunk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Oba wie jebeeden junt, Breeda, em Nomen von ons Har Jesus Christus, daut jie junt von jieda Brooda trigjtrakjen, dee onordentlich waundelt un nich no de Ordnunk, dee hee von ons jekjräajen haft. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 18:17">Mat 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:17">Ree 16:17</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:15">2Tess 2:15</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Wiels jie selfst weeten, woo jie ons nofoljen sellen, wiels wie haben ons nich onordentlich mank junt vehoolen, <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TH 1:6">1Tess 1:6</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />uk hab wie nich von irjentwäm emsonst Broot jejäten, oba wie haben met Mieej un Druck, Nacht un Dach jeoabeit, om nich irjentwäm von junt to belaustjen. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TH 2:9">1Tess 2:9</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Nich, daut wie nich daut Rajcht doatoo haben, oba om daut wie ons selfst aus Väabilt jäwen, daut jie ons nofoljen. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:35">Apj 20:35</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Flp 3:17</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Wiels uk aus wie bie junt wieren, befool wie junt dit: Wan irjentwäa nich oabeiden well, dee saul uk nich äten. <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Wiels wie hieren, daut atelje mank junt onordentlich waundlen un oabeiden nuscht, oba sikj romschnepren. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Soone aus daut jebeed wie un ermonen äant en däm Harn Jesus Christus, daut see em Stellen oabeiden un äa ieejnet Broot äten. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TH 4:11">1Tess 4:11</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Oba jie, Breeda, woat nich meed, Goodet to doonen. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GAL 6:9">Gal 6:9</ref></char><verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Wan oba irjentwäa ons Wuat derch disen Breef nich jehuarsom es, dän tieekjent aun un habt kjeenen Omgank met am, soo daut hee sikj schämt; <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />doch hoolt am nich aus eenen Fient, oba vemont am aus eenen Brooda. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TH 5:14">1Tess 5:14</ref></char><verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Säajen un Gruss</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Oba Hee, de Frädens-Har, jäw junt dän Fräd emma, opp aule Wäaj! Mucht de Har met junt aula sennen! <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 14:27">Joh 14:27</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />De Gruss met miene, Paulus siene, Haunt, dee daut Tieekjen es en jieda Breef; soo schriew ekj. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 16:21">1Kor 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:11">Gal 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:18">Kol 4:18</ref></char> <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />De Jnod von ons Har Jesus Christus sie met junt aula! Amen. <char style="add">De tweeda Breef aun de Tessalonicha jeschräwen von Ateen.</char><verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>